{
 "name": "Warder's Lifeline (Healer)",
 "description": "Justicar Warder + Linkstrider healer, zero weapon investment, Multifaceted. Pre-shrine (Power 15): Cha 90 / Fort 90 / Agi 40 / Will 30 (+1 Flame, Thunder, Frost). Post: Fort 80 (Reinforced Armor, Brace), Cha 65, Thunder 50 (Kickstart, Spark Swap, Lightning Cloak), Flame 50 + Will 40 (Undying Flame), Frost 20 (Glacial Arc), Agi 25.",
 "notes": "Multifaceted ON. Any starter sword. Pre-shrine order: Charisma 90 (Command: Live, Propagandist, Cornered Fool, Cult of Personality, Off Your Game), Fortitude 90 with Will 30 (Battle Tendency, Braced Collapse, Moving Fortress, Perseverance -> Reinforced Armor; Reinforce -> Grand Support), Agi 40 (Ghost). Put 1 point in Flame/Thunder/Frost before shrining. Shrine at Power 15. Post-shrine order: Flame 50 + Will 40 (Undying Flame), Thunder 50 (Kickstart, Spark Swap, Lightning Cloak), Frost 20 (Glacial Arc), Fort 80, Agi 25. Outfit: Familiar Knight's Armor for Hyperbody (35% DR + speed + regen aura for allies, 2 min CD); Warder's Attire (free with Warder path, Justicar's Gift) until you get it. Equipment: Deepscorn Casque (Already Dead: less damage from health-cost abilities = Symbiotic Sustain), Bastions/Wartreads of Enmity (Heart of Enmity drops; Ignition Gauntlets + Imperial Boots until then), Regenerative Pendant + Regenerative Earrings (temp HP on knock, +10% healing received with temp HP), Citadel Frames, Prophet's/Akira's/Waning/Moon rings. Pips: Health on armor, Ether on face/earrings.",
